msgid "External Force and Torque Application - Wrench Composers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/refs/release_notes.rst:146
msgid ""
"The ``set_external_force_and_torque()`` method on articulations, rigid "
"bodies, and rigid body collections has been deprecated in favor of a new "
"composable wrench system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/refs/release_notes.rst:148
msgid "Related PR: https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/3287"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/refs/release_notes.rst:150
msgid ""
"**New Features:** - **Permanent Wrench Composer**: Applies forces/torques"
" that persist across simulation steps until explicitly changed - "
"**Instantaneous Wrench Composer**: Applies forces/torques for a single "
"simulation step, then automatically resets - **Composability**: Multiple "
"forces and torques can now be added together on the same body - **Mixed "
"Frame Support**: Seamlessly compose local and global frame wrenches"
msgstr ""

