"Sim extensions have been renamed to use the prefix ``isaacsim``, "
"replacing ``omni.isaac``. In addition, many extensions have been renamed "
"and split into multiple extensions to prepare for a more modular "
"framework that can be customized by users through the use of app "
"templates."
