#: ../../source/refs/release_notes.rst:1730
msgid ""
"Previously, changing the simulation device to CPU required users to set "
"other simulation parameters (such as disabling GPU physics and GPU "
"pipelines). This made setting up the device appear complex. We now "
"simplify the checks for device directly inside the simulation context, so"
" users only need to specify the device through the configuration object."
msgstr ""

